 "note": "Lunenburg High School staff: 'SCHOOL STAFF' (line 1) headed by 'High School Principal', with the 'LHS SCHOOL COUNCIL' below. Three columns (x 0.13 / 0.41 / 0.66), names assigned by x position. Single-post headings (High School Principal, Assistant Principal, Administrative Secretary, Attendance Secretary, Computer Coordinator, Director of Athletics, Nurse, Director of Alternative Education) go in role_raw; department headings in grade_or_dept. The Assistant Principal (line 6) and Computer Coordinator (line 31) are printed as 'TBA' -- a vacancy, not a name, so no entry; line 6 is claimed by Peter Montalbano and line 31 is ignored. Line 15 is one Textract run 'Joshua Romano (long term sub) Claire Friedrich' spanning two columns: Joshua Romano is the English column (role 'long term sub'), Claire Friedrich the Science column. Lines 34-37 are the LHS School Council (parents, faculty, students, community) -- a council, not staff, ignored; line 38 is the page number."
